\`\`\`

casual:
\`\`\`
ok that hike destroyed me, 10/10 would do again
\`\`\`

# Guardrails
- Preserve the facts and intent of the request.
- Do not invent personal experiences, opinions or credentials.
- Adapt to the audience and the requested format.
"
`;
